<section class="py-10 sm:py-12 bg-white border-b border-stone-200" id="faq">
<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
<h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-brand-dark tracking-tight mb-5">
          Frequently Asked Questions
        </h2>
<!-- FAQ Items Grid -->
<div class="!grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3 items-start">
<!-- Q1 -->
<details class="border border-stone-200 rounded-xl p-4 hover:border-stone-400 transition cursor-pointer bg-brand-cream/30 group">
  <summary class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-stone-800 list-none">
    <span>Does it fit my garden hose?</span>
    <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-stone-500 flex-shrink-0 ml-2 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>
  </summary>
  <p class="mt-3 text-xs text-stone-600 leading-relaxed">Yes! It features a standard 3/4-inch thread connector compatible with virtually all outdoor garden hoses and indoor shower adapters.</p>
</details>
<!-- Q2 -->
<details class="border border-stone-200 rounded-xl p-4 hover:border-stone-400 transition cursor-pointer bg-brand-cream/30 group">
  <summary class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-stone-800 list-none">
    <span>Can I use my own shampoo?</span>
    <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-stone-500 flex-shrink-0 ml-2 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>
  </summary>
  <p class="mt-3 text-xs text-stone-600 leading-relaxed">Simply unscrew the clear soap container, fill it with your favorite pet shampoo, and turn the dial to activate soap mixing. Water and shampoo automatically blend into a rich lather.</p>
</details>
<!-- Q3 -->
<details class="border border-stone-200 rounded-xl p-4 hover:border-stone-400 transition cursor-pointer bg-brand-cream/30 group">
  <summary class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-stone-800 list-none">
    <span>Is it safe for all dog breeds?</span>
    <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-stone-500 flex-shrink-0 ml-2 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>
  </summary>
  <p class="mt-3 text-xs text-stone-600 leading-relaxed">Absolutely. The 3-mode dial allows you to select a soft gentle mist setting specifically designed for sensitive skin, puppies, and older dogs.</p>
</details>
<!-- Q4 -->
<details class="border border-stone-200 rounded-xl p-4 hover:border-stone-400 transition cursor-pointer bg-brand-cream/30 group">
  <summary class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold text-stone-800 list-none">
    <span>How do I clean it?</span>
    <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-stone-500 flex-shrink-0 ml-2 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>
  </summary>
  <p class="mt-3 text-xs text-stone-600 leading-relaxed">Rinse the soap reservoir with fresh warm water after each use and store indoors away from freezing temperatures.</p>
</details>
</div>
</div>
</section>

